    "title": "Milford drops two in tourney - NewsBreak",
    "text": "milfordtimes.net\nwebsite\nMilford\nMilford drops two in tourney\nBy Stephanie Croston, scroston@sewardindependent.com,\n8 hours agoThe Milford Post 171 juniors finished their season at the Area B1 tournament in Hickman July 12. Milford lost to Hickman 9-1 in the opener and then fell to Aurora 3-0. Hickman pitching held Milford’s bats in check July 11, allowing no hits. Milford had three baserunners – two via walks and one hit by a pitch.",
